1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Two friends. One last chance for a great haircut.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Back in a moment. My assistant will handle everything.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
A fresh look. That's all we wanted.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Something's off.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
That was definitely too much.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Our hair has other plans.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The front door is locked.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Hey! Stay away from my friend!

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Wait. There's another way.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Trust me.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Today, we just wanted a good haircut.
